<title>ITALY: BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTHOLZ, Italy 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from World Cup</p>
<p>biathlon races on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men's 4 x 7.5km relay race:</p>
<p>1. Germany (Ricco Gross, Mark Kirchner, Carsten Heymann, Frank</p>
<p>Luck) One hour 23 minutes 31.9 seconds.</p>
<p>2. Italy (Rene Cattarinussi, Wilfried Pallhuber, Patrick Favre,</p>
<p>Pier-Alberto Carrara) 1hr 23:53.4</p>
<p>3. Norway (Baerd Mjolne, Sylfest Glimsdal, Jon Age Tyldum, Ole</p>
<p>Einar Bjorndalen) 1h 24:14.7</p>
<p>Women's 4 x 7.5 km relay race:</p>
<p>1. Russia (Olga Melnik, Galina Kukleva, Nadecha Talanova, Olga</p>
<p>Romasko) 1hr 36:20.5</p>
<p>2. Norway (Ann Elen Skjelbreid, Annette Sikveland, Liv Grete</p>
<p>Skjelbreid, Gunn Margit Andreassen) 1hr 38:15.7</p>
<p>3. France (Delphyne Heymann-Burlet, Christelle Gros, Veronique</p>
<p>Claudel, Corinne Niogret) 1hr 38:43.9</p>
